minidbg

minidbg ports ideas and logic from unidbg (https://github.com/zhkl0228/unidbg),
which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

rootfs/lib64 holds Android 6.0 (API 23) system libraries taken from unidbg's
android/sdk23 resources. They come from the Android Open Source Project.
libcpp.so and libstdcpp.so are stored under their real names, libc++.so and
libstdc++.so.

tests/fixtures/arm64-v8a holds two sample libraries from unidbg's test
resources: libjnidispatch.so (JNA) and libtmessages.29.so (Telegram).
